    "narration": {
      "1": "Clicks stream in from the website…",
      "2": "…orders arrive by change-data-capture from the Orders DB…",
      "3": "…and partners drop nightly files into a bucket.",
      "4": "Ingest: two topics and a file loader.",
      "5": "The clicks topic: tens of thousands of events a minute.",
      "6": "The orders topic: every order change.",
      "7": "The file loader picks the files up and validates them.",
      "8": "Stream processing: three jobs, each with a consumer lag to watch.",
      "9": "The sessionizer stitches clicks into visits.",
      "10": "The fraud scorer rates every order within seconds.",
      "11": "The enricher joins orders with customers, products and partner files.",
      "12": "Storage: freshness is the number that matters here.",
      "13": "Sessions land in the data lake.",
      "14": "Fraud scores and features go to the feature store.",
      "15": "The warehouse holds the modelled tables.",
      "16": "Recommendations read features in real time.",
      "17": "Analysts read the warehouse through BI dashboards."
